<p>Taskeen e Qalbe Zehra(s.a) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)<br />
Zainab(s.a) ka tha ye nouha Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>1. Ummul Banee'n(s.a) ke pyaare, Haider(a.s) ke jigar paare<br />
Aye Noore ain e Zehre(s.a) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>2. Katwake Apne Baazu Tum sogaye Naher par<br />
Kya hoega Haram ka Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>3. Sharminda bhatiji se you'n hogaye ke laasha<br />
Khaime me tak na aayaAbbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>4. Tha choor tan e sarwar(a.s) har zaqm dil se har dam<br />
Aati thi ye sada Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>5. Aada ne cheenli jab Zainab(s.a) ke sar se chaadar<br />
Zainab(s.a) ka tha ye nouha Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>6. Kyu'n Sarfaraaz mushkil Apne ko hogi haayil<br />
Apna to hai sahaara Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

